# Code owners for LasceUCR/lasce
#
# Every pull request into `main` or `development` needs an approving review
# from at least one of the people listed here. This is enforced by the branch
# rulesets in .github/rulesets/ (`require_code_owner_review`), not by this
# file on its own.
